{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Meeting New People", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Thank You for the Invitation, but ...", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange personal information about the home and family in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Declining Simple Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these phrases to politely refuse (say no) to a request. You respond with these phrases.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Decline a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Response </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unfortunately, I can't ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Okay, no problem. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I really want to ... but ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's too bad.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sorry, I can't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I understand.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you help me tomorrow afternoon?<br /><span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  Unfortunately, I can't.<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay, no problem. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Connectors: And, Or, But", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Connectors are words you use to join words, phrases and sentences. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">and</span> to join two ideas.<br /> You use <span class=\"strong\">but</span>  to show contrast or difference. <br /> You use <span class=\"strong\">or</span>  to show two opposing ideas.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart. Do you know how to use the three connectors?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"4\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Connector </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Function </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"and\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"join same ideas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Tom likes to watch and play sports. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"or\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show choice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You can take the bus or drive.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"but\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show contrast\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> John likes to watch the news, but he doesn't like to read the newspaper. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "game ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a competition of a sport ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's go to a hockey game tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " You  use these words to cancel plans because of bad weather.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "soccer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sport played between two teams who try to kick a ball into the other team's goal ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Soccer is a popular sport all over the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "team ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of people who work together or play a sport", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A soccer team has eleven players.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cancel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to decide a planned activity or event will not happen ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I cancel all  my plans when the weather gets bad.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "unfortunately ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to say when something is sad and has a bad effect ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Unfortunately, the game is canceled because of the rain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wet ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes something that has water on it; it is not dry ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My coat is wet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wind ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "air moving very fast ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wind is very strong today. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fall from the sky, usually in the form of water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's going to rain tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le02ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write